    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Enjoying an attractive ground floor position within the much sought after Charlesland development, this well-presented two-bedroom apartment combines bright, well-proportioned accommodation with a highly convenient location close to local shops, schools, transport links and the many amenities Greystones has to offer.\r\nThe property benefits from its own private street-level entrance and is positioned in an established, leafy part of the development, where mature trees, hedging and landscaped green spaces create an appealing residential setting.\r\nInside, accommodation is centred around an exceptionally spacious open-plan kitchen/dining/living room extending to over seven metres in length. This bright and airy living space combines comfortable sitting and dining areas with a fitted kitchen, creating a practical hub for day-to-day living and entertaining.\r\nThe living area is enhanced by timber-effect flooring and a feature fireplace, while glazed double doors open directly onto a private outdoor area with timber decking. Bordered by mature hedging and overlooking the development’s tree-lined surroundings, this provides an inviting space for sitting out, outdoor dining or simply relaxing on fine days.\r\nThe kitchen is arranged in open-plan configuration with the main living space and features fitted floor and eye-level units, timber countertops, tiled splashbacks and provision for a range of appliances. A useful pantry/storage cupboard is positioned directly off the adjoining hallway.\r\nThe apartment has two bedrooms, both positioned to the rear of the property and provided with fitted wardrobes. The main bedroom is a generously proportioned double, while the second bedroom offers a versatile space suitable for use as a single bedroom, guest room or home office.\r\nAccommodation is completed by a well-appointed main bathroom with bath and overhead shower, WC and wash hand basin, along with an entrance lobby, internal hallway, hot press and additional storage.\r\nPresented in good condition throughout, the apartment is decorated predominantly in light, neutral tones that complement the natural light, while timber-effect flooring running through much of the accommodation creates a warm and consistent finish.\r\nWith its own front door, single-level layout, private outdoor space and highly convenient location, Number 246 is an ideal choice for first-time buyers, couples, singletons, downsizers and investors alike.\r\nCall us today to arrange a viewing of this must-see modern apartment.\r\nFEATURES\r\n•\tTwo-bedroom ground floor own-door apartment \r\n•\tExceptionally spacious open-plan kitchen/dining/living room \r\n•\tPrivate street-level entrance \r\n•\tTwo bedrooms with fitted wardrobes \r\n•\tMain bathroom with bath and overhead shower \r\n•\tFitted kitchen with timber countertops and tiled splashbacks \r\n•\tFeature fireplace in living area \r\n•\tTimber-effect flooring through principal living areas and bedrooms \r\n•\tUseful pantry, hot press and additional storage \r\n•\tPrivate outdoor area with timber decking \r\n•\tMature hedging providing an attractive leafy outlook \r\n•\tWell-presented throughout \r\n•\tEstablished residential setting with mature trees and landscaped green spaces \r\n•\tNeighbourhood shops and services within easy walking distance \r\n•\tWithin easy reach of Greystones town centre, DART station and seafront \r\n•\tConvenient access to local schools, sporting facilities and transport links \r\nLOCATION\r\nCharlesland is a mature and popular residential development on the southern side of Greystones, characterised by extensive landscaped amenity greens, mature trees, planting areas, pedestrian routes and recreational spaces. This leafy setting is particularly evident around Charlesland Wood, where established landscaping gives the development an attractive, settled feel. \r\nThe property is within easy walking distance of the Charlesland neighbourhood shopping area, providing a convenient range of everyday shops and services, including a large SuperValu supermarket. Nearby recreational amenities include the Shoreline facilities and the extensive network of green spaces and walking routes throughout Charlesland. \r\nGreystones town centre is also within easy reach, with its bustling selection of supermarkets, shops, boutiques and other retail outlets, along with the pubs, cafés, bistros and restaurants that make the town such a popular lifestyle choice. The town's coastal setting provides an additional attraction, with Greystones Marina, beaches and seafront among its many recreational amenities. \r\nThe wider Greystones area offers an excellent choice of sporting and leisure facilities, with clubs catering for activities including rugby, GAA, soccer, tennis, golf, sailing and rowing, while the Wicklow countryside and its many walking and mountain trails are within easy driving distance. \r\nThere is also an excellent choice of schools in the surrounding area. Greystones Community National School and Greystones Community College are particularly close to Charlesland, while further primary and secondary school options are available throughout Greystones and neighbouring Delgany. \r\nFor commuters, Charlesland is well served by local bus connections, while Greystones DART Station provides rail services towards Dublin. The nearby N11/M11 road network also provides convenient access to Dublin, the M50 and other destinations along the east coast."
      },
